      "extractedText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nc\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Iqumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR TEN (10) UNITS LAPTOP FOR THE USE OF\nTHE OFFICE OF THE SANGGUNIANG BAYAN, MIAGAO, ILOILO\n1.\nThe Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Account Number 1021-1-07-05-030 Budget Year 2018 intends to apply\nthe sum of P 350,000.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to\npayments under the contract for Ten (10) Units Laptop for the use of the Office of the\nSangguniang Bayan, Miagao, Iloilo. Bids received in excess of the ABC shall be\nautomatically rejected at bid opening.\n2.\nThe Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM\nNO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\nlot\nTen (10) Units laptop bundled with one unit Network\n1\nAttached Storage with the following minimum\nspecifications:\nfor laptop:\nPROCESSOR: 2-CORE. 4 THREADS\n6TH GEN processor (3MB L3 cache, 2.0 GHz)\nMEMORY: 4GB of DDR4 system memory\nOS: LATEST, 64-bit OS\nHARD DISK: 1TB 2.5 inch 5400 RPM\nDISPLAY: 15\" HD+\nODD: DVD +/-RW\nGRAPHICS: Integrated HD\nEXTERNAL: USB 3.0, USB 2.0 and HDMI port portS, support\nI/O PORTS: Ethernet (RJ-45) and External display (VGA)\nport\nOTHERS: HD Webcam, speakers, microphone, WiFi\nBATTERY: 4-cell Li-ion battery pack\nWARRANTY: 1 year Limited Local Warranty (Parts and\nLabor\nCASE / BAG: Carrying Bag / knapsack/case\nfor NAS:\n2 Drive Bays, RJ-45 connection with 2 units\n1 TB SATA HDD\n1",
      "ocrText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nc\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Iqumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR TEN (10) UNITS LAPTOP FOR THE USE OF\nTHE OFFICE OF THE SANGGUNIANG BAYAN, MIAGAO, ILOILO\n1.\nThe Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Account Number 1021-1-07-05-030 Budget Year 2018 intends to apply\nthe sum of P 350,000.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to\npayments under the contract for Ten (10) Units Laptop for the use of the Office of the\nSangguniang Bayan, Miagao, Iloilo. Bids received in excess of the ABC shall be\nautomatically rejected at bid opening.\n2.\nThe Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM\nNO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\nlot\nTen (10) Units laptop bundled with one unit Network\n1\nAttached Storage with the following minimum\nspecifications:\nfor laptop:\nPROCESSOR: 2-CORE. 4 THREADS\n6TH GEN processor (3MB L3 cache, 2.0 GHz)\nMEMORY: 4GB of DDR4 system memory\nOS: LATEST, 64-bit OS\nHARD DISK: 1TB 2.5 inch 5400 RPM\nDISPLAY: 15\" HD+\nODD: DVD +/-RW\nGRAPHICS: Integrated HD\nEXTERNAL: USB 3.0, USB 2.0 and HDMI port portS, support\nI/O PORTS: Ethernet (RJ-45) and External display (VGA)\nport\nOTHERS: HD Webcam, speakers, microphone, WiFi\nBATTERY: 4-cell Li-ion battery pack\nWARRANTY: 1 year Limited Local Warranty (Parts and\nLabor\nCASE / BAG: Carrying Bag / knapsack/case\nfor NAS:\n2 Drive Bays, RJ-45 connection with 2 units\n1 TB SATA HDD\n1",
